    "oak": {
      "__comment": [
        "Oak tree \u00e2\u20ac\u201d slow-growing deciduous hardwood, the cornerstone of the brewing economy.",
        "oak_stave drops are required for crafting barrels and casks used in wine and spirit aging.",
        "Also the premium furniture material for high-end colony builds.",
        "Deciduous: four seasonal models (spring fresh green, summer deep, autumn gold, winter bare).",
        "Slowest-growing tree; planting oaks is a long-term investment.",
        "Three growth stages: sapling \u00e2\u2020\u2019 mature \u00e2\u2020\u2019 ancient.",
        "",
        "MODEL VARIANTS (mature and ancient only):",
        "  Season values may be a single string OR an array of strings.",
        "  If an array, the tree system picks one entry at spawn time via a world-position hash.",
        "  The same tree always shows the same variant \u00e2\u20ac\u201d no runtime flickering.",
        "  Ancient: summer x3, autumn x2, spring x1, winter x1.",
        "  Mature: approved single summer/winter models (doc 26); spring x1 and autumn x2 retain the earlier art.",
        "  Art brief: all variants share the same trunk position and XZ footprint.",
        "  Only the canopy shape, branch layout, and silhouette differ between variants.",
        "  Naming: oak_mature_summer.glb \u00e2\u2020\u2019 base (variant 1), oak_mature_summer_2.glb, oak_mature_summer_3.glb."
